               obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000122 ;
               obo:IAO_0000116 "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'electric field strength' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'electrical quality'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions. The definition is adapted from: https://www.britannica.com/science/electric-field."@en ;
