                               "cubic Bravais lattice with primitive centering (cP), having four 3-fold rotation axes with all unit cell axes equal and mutually perpendicular and one lattice point per unit cell"@en ;
               co:PMD_0000060 "true"^^xsd:boolean .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020018
co:PMD_0020018 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
               rdfs:label "Bravais-Gitter kubisch raumzentriert"@de ,
                          "OBSOLETE bravais lattice cubic body-centered"@en ;
